# What this repo tracks on purpose:
#   - the Unity project source (Assets/, Packages/, ProjectSettings/)
#   - all Python training code (python/)
#   - the offline data-prep scripts (data-prep/) and the docs (docs/)
#   - data/image_encoder.pt, the trained encoder -- not reproducible on demand
#
# What it deliberately does NOT track, and how to get each one:
#   Builds/            build it: Unity -batchmode -quit -nographics \
#                        -executeMethod BuildPlayer.BuildLinux
#   data/formations/   generate it: python data-prep/quickdraw_to_png.py
#   results/           produced by training runs
#
# Builds/ and data/formations/ used to be committed -- a 158 MB player and
# 679 MB of PNGs, 99.4% of all tracked files -- even though the Dockerfile
# already stated they were not in version control. See docs/development.md.

# ─── Unity generated ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
[Ll]ibrary/
[Tt]emp/
[Oo]bj/
[Ll]ogs/
[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
[Aa]rtifacts/
MemoryCaptures/
Recordings/

# ─── Build output (reproducible from Assets/Editor/BuildPlayer.cs) ────────────
Builds/

# ─── Generated datasets (reproducible from data-prep/) ────────────────────────
data/formations/

# ─── IDE ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vs/
.vscode/
*.csproj
*.slnx
*.sln
*.suo
*.user
*.pidb
*.booproj

# ─── Python ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo
.env
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
python/temp_test_material/

# ─── Training output and tool output ──────────────────────────────────────────
results/
graphify-out/
*.onnx
*.log

# ─── OS / misc ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
tree.txt
kilobot-gnn/
kilobot-gnn.zip
